message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "lng-robust-design: engine, data and results for the price of robustness in modular LNG refrigeration"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fadoyeni
    given-names: Tunji
  - family-names: Owhonda
    given-names: Gideon
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gidoty/lng-robust-design"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
abstract: >-
  Python engine for risk-averse design of single mixed refrigerant and nitrogen expander LNG cycles under variable Niger Delta
  associated-gas composition: property layer (Peng-Robinson via thermo), cycle models, two-stage CVaR design, surrogate
  screening with false-feasible-rate reliability, ranking-reversal and sensitivity analysis. Code is MIT-licensed, data are CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - LNG
  - robust optimisation
  - conditional value-at-risk
  - nitrogen expander
  - single mixed refrigerant
  - Niger Delta
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
